<title>UK: Renault Credit sets 1.5 bln FFR bond.</title>
<headline>Renault Credit sets 1.5 bln FFR bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RENAULT CREDIT INTERNATIONAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.3 PCT   MATURITY    15.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.64    PAY DATE    15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.7 PCT   REOFFER    99.34     SPREAD	+41 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OAT 2008 AND OAT 2011</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
